Application registration<pre><code>from langgraph_openai_serve import GraphConfig, GraphRegistry, LanggraphOpenaiServe

registry = GraphRegistry(
    graphs={
        "my-graph": GraphConfig(
            graph=my_graph,
            description="Answer questions with my graph.",
        ),
        "mcp-mock": GraphConfig(
            graph=mcp_mock_graph,
            description="Answer questions with asynchronously loaded tools.",
        ),
    }
)

app = LanggraphOpenaiServe(registry=registry).bind_openai_api().app
</code></pre> <p><code>registry.graphs</code> is a plain dict. <code>GraphConfig</code> declarations are immutable; their feature and server-tool frozen sets cannot be changed after registration.</p>
